      "index": "a096",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Transactional outbox prevents lost validation events.\nDeduplicate by eventId. Extend SQS visibility during analysis.\nAcknowledge only after audit and result are durable.\nRepeated failures reach DLQ, then pending_review.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Transactional outbox prevents lost validation events.\nDeduplicate by eventId. Extend SQS visibility during analysis.\nAcknowledge only after audit and result are durable.\nRepeated failures reach DLQ, then pending_review.",
      "lineHeight": 1.35,
      "autoResize": false
    },
