      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Reported content adds 20 latest + 20 highest-scored comments,\ndeduplicated with truncation marker. Send up/down/net totals only.\nNever send voter identity, email, credentials, presigned URLs,\nor unrelated profile data.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Reported content adds 20 latest + 20 highest-scored comments,\ndeduplicated with truncation marker. Send up/down/net totals only.\nNever send voter identity, email, credentials, presigned URLs,\nor unrelated profile data.",
