      "index": "a102",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Sentiment supports review; it does not define validity.\nTreat post, comment, and image text as untrusted input.\nRequire strict JSON; store no chain-of-thought.\nAI never bans, suspends, or permanently removes content.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Sentiment supports review; it does not define validity.\nTreat post, comment, and image text as untrusted input.\nRequire strict JSON; store no chain-of-thought.\nAI never bans, suspends, or permanently removes content.",
